    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hamill Estate Agents are proud to present No. 63 Mount Prospect Drive to the sales market — a charming mid-terraced residence ideally positioned on one of the area’s most desirable and family-friendly roads. Situated within this highly sought-after enclave, the property offers an exciting opportunity for discerning buyers to create a modern home in a location renowned for its strong community spirit, excellent amenities, and superb coastal setting.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 102 sq. m., this much-loved home immediately impresses with its clean-lines and welcoming atmosphere.  No.63, is ready to move-in but also provides excellent potential for extension and redesign, allowing purchasers the opportunity to tailor the accommodation to suit contemporary living or growing family need.\r\n\r\nThe internal accommodation is both spacious and versatile. An inviting entrance hallway leads through to a generously proportioned living room, where double doors open into the rear family room, creating an ideal setting for both everyday living and entertaining. A separate dining room connects directly to the kitchen area, which overlooks and provides access to the rear garden. With thoughtful redesign, this space offers excellent scope to create an open-plan kitchen, dining, and living environment suited to modern lifestyles.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms, including two spacious double bedrooms and a single bedroom, along with a separate bathroom and toilet.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property enjoys a mature rear garden extending to approximately 58 feet in length. Exceptionally private and not overlooked, the garden further benefits from rear access via a secure gated laneway running parallel to Woodside and St. Anne's Park. This highly valuable access point serves a number of adjoining homes and significantly enhances the practicality and appeal of the property.\r\n\r\nNo. 63 Mount Prospect Drive enjoys a superb location just off Mount Prospect Avenue, an address long favoured by families thanks to its sense of community, mature surroundings, and expansive green areas. Residents are within walking distance of both the vibrant villages of Clontarf and Killester, where an abundance of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, and shopping facilities can be found. The nearby seafront promenade and St. Anne’s Park offer exceptional recreational amenities, while the area is also home to an excellent selection of preschools, primary schools, secondary schools, and sporting clubs.\r\n\r\nTransport connectivity is excellent, with the 130 bus route servicing the area and nearby DART stations providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nCombining charm, location, and exceptional potential to extend (SPP), No. 63 Mount Prospect Drive represents a rare opportunity to acquire a home in one of Dublin’s most established and desirable residential communities. Viewing is highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Open Porch:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\t\t4.18m x 1.98m\t\tWith carpet flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\t\t3.76 m x 3.57m\t\tWith carpet flooring, and double doors to the family room.\r\n\r\nFamily Room:\t\t4.30 m x 3.29m\t\tWith carpet flooring, and a fireplace.\r\n\r\nDining Room:\t\t2.75 m x 2.43m\t\tWith laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen:\t\t3.28m x 2.44m\t\t        With laminate flooring, wall and floor units, and a tiled splashback.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \t\t3.64m x 3.33m \t   \tWith carpet flooring and built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t\t4.32m x 3.33m \t   \tWith carpet flooring and built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \t\t2.67m x 2.45m \t   \tWith carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom:   \t\t1.65m x 1.59m\t\tWith a bath & w.h.b.\r\n\r\nW.C."
